{"question_id": 8, "question": "À qui signaler une situation de harcèlement, de racisme ou de violence sexiste et sexuelle ?", "method": "m2_rag_rerank", "experiment_id": "pilot_m2", "model": "mistralai/Ministral-8B-Instruct-2410", "backend": "vllm", "index": "indexes/current/index.jsonl", "top_k": 5, "route_boost_weight_requested": 1.0, "confidence_threshold": null, "semantic_threshold": null, "temperature": 0.1, "top_p": 0.8, "seed": 42, "mode": "standard", "prompt_mode": "standard", "retrieval_mode": "heuristic_rerank", "route_boost_weight": 1.0, "abstain": false, "answer": "Pour signaler une situation de harcèlement, de racisme ou de violence sexiste et sexuelle, vous pouvez contacter la référente mission prévention à l'adresse [mission-prevention@inalco.fr](mailto:mission-prevention@inalco.fr). Vous pouvez également appeler la Police secours au 17 ou le numéro Violence femmes au 3919 (24h/24 et 7j/7).\n\nSources :\n- [Portail étudiant Inalco](https://portail-etudiant.inalco.fr/fr/autres/urgences.html)", "sources": [{"rank": 1, "score": 0.8675, "semantic_score": 0.8675, "title": "Urgences", "section_title": "**Victime de harcèlement ?**", "audience": ["all"], "journey_stage": "general", "academic_years": [], "source_url": "https://portail-etudiant.inalco.fr/fr/autres/urgences.html", "parent_url": null, "document_title": null, "page_start": null, "page_end": null, "validity_period": null, "quality_status": "review", "review_priority": "P0"}, {"rank": 2, "score": 0.862, "semantic_score": 0.862, "title": "Urgences", "section_title": "Victime de harcèlement ?", "audience": ["all"], "journey_stage": "general", "academic_years": [], "source_url": "https://portail-etudiant.inalco.fr/fr/autres/urgences.html", "parent_url": null, "document_title": null, "page_start": null, "page_end": null, "validity_period": null, "quality_status": "review", "review_priority": "P0"}, {"rank": 3, "score": 0.8573, "semantic_score": 0.8573, "title": "Harcèlement, racisme et VSS", "section_